{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17106640","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17106640","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1710664001:1":{"text":"Everyone, that disturbance must have been frightening.","source_cn":"诸位，刚才的那场骚乱，想必让大家受惊了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8589F027C07FC4DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710664002:1":{"text":"Yet this incident has proven a valuable test, revealing to me where our empire's true strength lies.","source_cn":"然而，这场意外，也如同试金石一般，令我看到了帝国真正的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2274D24997DFBFEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710664003:1":{"text":"Today's hunt was interrupted, but thanks to Captain Gwyneth's swift action, the monster is dead. She protected the crown and everyone present.","source_cn":"今日行猎，虽有巨蛛侵扰，但幸亏格温妮丝队长及时出手，射...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42AC0E3865B79E43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710664004:1":{"text":"Captain Gwyneth, step forward.","source_cn":"格温妮丝队长，请出列。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F0107E1C237AAFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710664005:1":{"text":"Yes, Your Highness.","source_cn":"是，殿下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E8CA6C3D6C1E86A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710664006:1":{"text":"Facing danger with unwavering calm, her arrow found its mark. Her loyalty and skill are clear to all.","source_cn":"格温妮丝队长临危不惧，以精准的箭术射杀巨蛛，其忠诚与能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FD4F2F0715F57B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710664007:1":{"text":"To honor her extraordinary service, I hereby promote Gwyneth to Vanguard Officer of the Lightbearer Knights, with posting to Ashvale County.","source_cn":"为表彰格温妮丝的卓著功勋，我决定，即刻起，擢升格温妮丝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x395EE7BEE433A171","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710664008:1":{"text":"To become a vanguard officer at such a young age... This is unprecedented!","source_cn":"如此年纪轻轻就能当上先锋官的，在耀光是第一人吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x900368FF017FA303","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710664009:1":{"text":"Ashvale County? That's the frontier. The situation there is tense!","source_cn":"灰影郡……那里可是边陲，现下局势很紧张啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE71D47FF8EECF8F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710664010:1":{"text":"Precisely. As a key border territory, the Bantus Empire has long coveted it. House Rayne there has repelled multiple invasions.","source_cn":"正是如此，作为耀光的边陲重镇，班题斯屡次妄想染指于它。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x557423BEDDF22FDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710664011:1":{"text":"It is a heavy responsibility, and a great honor. Gwyneth, that is where your talents can truly shine.","source_cn":"这是一份重担，也是一份光荣。格温妮丝，那里才是能真正施...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFE3EB28BD36F809","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710664012:1":{"text":"I am certain your presence will help secure our victory.","source_cn":"我相信，你的加入，必将为帝国带来胜利的曙光。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x300A927E2EAB02B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710664013:1":{"text":"Vanguard Officer of Ashvale County...","source_cn":"灰影郡的先锋官……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DA6731569FEACC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奥利安":{"text":"Orion","source":"奥利安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"Gwyneth","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:男爵葛朗台":{"text":"Baron Grandet","source":"男爵葛朗台","st